  Holts_Linear   AIC       30,862.8   BIC       30,883.9
  SARIMAX        AIC       33,913.0   BIC       33,960.4
  SARIMAX_nw     AIC       33,898.1   BIC       33,924.5
  Prophet        n/a — not a likelihood-based model
  LSTM           n/a — not a likelihood-based model
  Prophet_nw     n/a — not a likelihood-based model
  LSTM_nw        n/a — not a likelihood-based model

  Lower is better, and ONLY comparable within this family. AIC/BIC cannot
  rank SARIMAX against Prophet or the LSTM — different likelihoods, or none.

